msgid "平台工程手册"
msgstr "Platform engineering handbook"

msgid ""
"Nexus 只维护可复用的嵌入式机制。应用、任务、协议策略和私有 PCB 数据由外部工程维护。 生产代码采用 C11 "
"和必要的启动汇编；公共接口不暴露厂商类型。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus maintains reusable embedded mechanisms. Applications, tasks, protocol "
"policy and private PCB data belong in external projects. Production code "
"uses C11 and necessary startup assembly; public interfaces do not expose "
"vendor types."

msgid "构建与配置"
msgstr "Build and configuration"

msgid ""
"TOML schema 2 是装配输入，JSON 保存芯片和板级事实。集中式 Python 配置器验证资源， 生成不可变配置、静态实例和强类型 "
"factory。SoC、Board 和固件算法直接使用 C。 CMake target 是软件依赖的唯一权威。初始化不启动调度器，factory "
"查询不初始化硬件。"
msgstr ""
"TOML schema 2 is the assembly input; JSON records chip and board facts. The "
"centralized Python configuration tool validates resources and generates "
"immutable configuration, static instances and a strongly typed factory. SoC,"
" Board and firmware algorithms use C directly. CMake targets alone own "
"software dependencies. Initialization does not start a scheduler, and "
"factory lookup does not initialize hardware."

msgid ""
"保留厂商仓库、精确 gitlink、来源锁和许可证。默认只准备和编译选中的 STM32F4 依赖。 其他系列留作库存，不进入默认测试、编译或 "
"SDK。生产范围以精确器件、板卡和模式为准。"
msgstr ""
"Preserve vendor repositories, exact gitlinks, source locks and licenses. "
"Default preparation and compilation select only the STM32F4 dependencies. "
"Other families remain inventory and do not enter default tests, builds or "
"SDKs. Production scope is defined by exact part, board and mode."

msgid "测试保留规则"
msgstr "Test retention rules"

msgid ""
"新增行为和缺陷修复先执行可复现的 RED，再实现 GREEN，随后重构。 C 合同使用 GoogleTest／GoogleMock，工具使用 "
"Python unittest。 模拟外部硬件和内核边界，直接执行真实平台实现。"
msgstr ""
"Execute a reproducible RED for new behavior and defect fixes, implement "
"GREEN, then refactor. C contracts use GoogleTest/GoogleMock; tools use "
"Python unittest. Mock external hardware and kernel boundaries while "
"executing the actual platform implementation."

msgid ""
"保留所有权、取消、超时、IRQ、DMA、停止失败、故障恢复、实例隔离和资源预算的回归。 纯 C "
"公共头、ABI、向量和链接检查也必须保留。不要只按测试数量或文件名删除用例。 共享算法的通用断言按实现类别执行；编译配置变体只补充各自差异的断言。"
msgstr ""
"Retain regressions for ownership, cancellation, timeout, IRQ, DMA, failed "
"stop, recovery, instance isolation and resource budgets. Keep pure C public-"
"header, ABI, vector and link checks. Never delete cases solely by count or "
"filename. Run common algorithm assertions per implementation class; compile-"
"time variants add assertions for their actual differences."

msgid ""
"废弃功能应同时删除入口、实现、测试、构建配置、打包清单和文档。 等价重复断言只保留一处权威；有独立故障路径或编译上下文的测试不是重复。 "
"历史报告保存在固定 Git 提交，不在当前源码树重复保存归档、恢复包和任务台账。"
msgstr ""
"Retire an obsolete feature together with its entry points, implementation, "
"tests, build configuration, package lists and documentation. Keep one "
"authority for equivalent assertions; distinct failure paths and compiler "
"contexts are not duplicates. Historical reports remain at fixed Git commits "
"rather than duplicated archives, recovery bundles and task ledgers in the "
"current source tree."

msgid "自动化入口"
msgstr "Automation entry points"

msgid ""
"安装开发工具后启用标准 pre-commit 和 commit-msg hook。不得跳过 hook 或自动暂存修复。 "
"提交检查读取完整暂存区，执行格式、注释、文档、工作流和行为检查。 行为门禁只配置、构建一次，然后执行完整 Native GoogleTest "
"和受影响的完整工具域。 构建和配置规则变更执行全部工具域；文档改动仍检查配置示例和双语完整性。"
msgstr ""
"Install the development tools and enable the standard pre-commit and commit-"
"msg hooks. Never bypass hooks or stage fixes automatically. Commit checks "
"read the complete index and execute format, comment, documentation, workflow"
" and behavior checks. The behavior gate configures and builds once, then "
"runs the complete Native GoogleTest plan and affected complete tool domains."
" Build and configuration policy changes run all tool domains; documentation "
"changes still check configuration examples and bilingual completeness."

msgid ""
"两条命令是完整普通开发门禁的替代入口，不需要连续执行两遍。 完整 CI 分别执行 "
"testing、configure、ci、workflows、contracts、freertos 工具域， 以及 native-"
"debug、native-release、native-asan、native-tsan 的完整 CTest 计划。 Native "
"模式不重复执行与模式无关的工具测试。ARM 和迁移后的 SDK 消费者验证独立执行。"
msgstr ""
"The two commands are alternative entry points for the complete ordinary "
"development gate; do not run both consecutively. Complete CI executes the "
"testing, configure, ci, workflows, contracts and freertos tool domains "
"separately, plus the complete CTest plans for native-debug, native-release, "
"native-asan and native-tsan. Native modes do not repeat mode-independent "
"tool tests. ARM and relocated SDK consumer validation execute separately."

msgid "输出必须新鲜、非空，保留实际返回码。缺失工具、跳过用例和旧报告不能建立通过状态。 最多使用分配的并发预算，避免多个构建同时占满内存。"
msgstr ""
"Outputs must be fresh and nonempty, with actual exit codes. Missing tools, "
"skipped cases and old reports cannot establish a pass. Stay within the "
"assigned concurrency budget and avoid simultaneous builds that exhaust "
"memory."

msgid "代码与审查"
msgstr "Code and review"

msgid ""
"沿用 .clang-format、.editorconfig 和反斜杠 Doxygen 风格：80 列、四空格、同行花括号。 "
"注释说明约束、所有权和硬件顺序，避免逐行复述代码。禁止重新设定历史风格债务基线。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the existing .clang-format, .editorconfig and backslash Doxygen style: "
"80 columns, four spaces and attached braces. Comments explain constraints, "
"ownership and hardware ordering rather than restating code line by line. "
"Never rebaseline historical style debt."

msgid ""
"优先复用经审核的官方 HAL／LL，厂商 handle 留在实现内部。一个控制器只有一个硬件 owner。 借用一直保留到最终 "
"SETTLED；取消和排空失败不能提前回收缓冲。应用拥有调度和恢复策略。 中断、生命周期、存储和并发改动须独立审查。普通重构的验证成本应与实际风险相称。"
msgstr ""
"Prefer reviewed official HAL/LL implementations and keep vendor handles "
"private. A controller has one hardware owner. Borrows remain live until "
"final SETTLED; cancellation or failed drain cannot reclaim buffers early. "
"Applications own scheduling and recovery policy. Interrupt, lifecycle, "
"storage and concurrency changes need independent review. Validation costs "
"for ordinary refactoring should match the actual risk."

msgid "交付边界"
msgstr "Delivery boundaries"

msgid ""
"Native 验证软件模型，ARM ELF 验证编译、链接和资源，Source SDK 验证独立消费。 "
"它们不能替代真实板卡上的时钟、延迟、吞吐、功耗和故障测量。物理 HIL 保持 not_executed。 PR "
"记录当前变更、真实验证结果和剩余限制，不维护重复的候选发布或任务台账系统。"
msgstr ""
"Native validates software models, ARM ELF validates compilation, linking and"
" resources, and Source SDK validates independent consumption. These do not "
"replace real-board measurements of clocks, latency, throughput, power and "
"faults. Physical HIL remains not_executed. PRs record changes, actual "
"validation and remaining limits without a duplicate candidate-promotion or "
"task-ledger system."
